### =========================================================================
### 🎓 REGISTER — gumawa ng bagong account
### 📅 Day 13 · Phase 4 (Register at login) · in-update sa Day 14 (validation → 400, lowercase email)
### =========================================================================
### POST /api/auth/register  { email, password, name? }
###   → Zod: suriin at linisin (trim + lowercase ang email) → maling input = 400
###   → i-hash ang password (argon2) → INSERT → 201 + ang user (walang hash!)
###   → dobleng email → UNIQUE ng database → 23505 → 409
###
### PAANO GAMITIN (REST Client extension):
###   1. cd devops && docker compose up -d      (database)
###   2. cd backend && npm run dev              (server)
###   3. I-send ang mga request mula taas pababa — ginagamit ng #2 ang sagot ng #1
###
### Code: backend/src/routes/auth.js · backend/src/validations/auth.js · Migration: backend/drizzle/0001_*.sql
### Diagram: docs/diagrams/03-register-flow.md
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Bagong account. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  201 Created
###    Body:    { "user": { "id": 1, "email": "demo-...@example.com", "name": "Demo" } }
###
### 🔍 Pansinin:
###   - WALANG password o password_hash sa sagot — `.returning()` ng piling column lang
###   - `{{$timestamp}}` = kasalukuyang oras → bagong email bawat send, kaya laging 201
###   - Tingnan sa psql:  SELECT email, password_hash FROM users;  → $argon2id$...
# @name register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Demo"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PAREHONG email ulit (kinuha mula sa sagot ng #1). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  409 Conflict
###    Body:    { "error": "Email already registered" }
###
### 🔍 Walang "SELECT muna" sa code — INSERT agad, at ang UNIQUE ng database ang
### tumatanggi. Kaya tama pa rin kahit sabay ang maraming request (sinubukan:
### 5 sabay → isang 201, apat na 409).
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{register.response.body.$.user.email}}",
  "password": "iba-namang-password"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Walang `name` (optional). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  201 Created
###    Body:    { "user": { ..., "name": null } }
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "walang-name-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### =========================================================================
### 🔒 VALIDATION (Day 14) — dating mga butas ng Day 13, ngayon 400 na
### =========================================================================
### Ang hugis ng 400:
###   { "error": "Invalid input", "fields": { "<field>": ["<paliwanag>"] } }
### Lahat ng mali ay sabay na iniuulat — hindi isa-isa.

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Walang password. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  400 Bad Request
###    Body:    { "error": "Invalid input",
###               "fields": { "password": ["Invalid input: expected string, received undefined"] } }
###    (Day 13: 500 — TypeError mula sa argon2)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "walang-password@example.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Walang email. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  400 — "fields": { "email": ["Invalid input: expected string, received undefined"] }
###    (Day 13: 500, at 🔐 lumalabas pa ang password hash sa error — hindi na umaabot sa database ngayon)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Maraming mali nang sabay. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  400
###    Body:    "fields": { "email": ["Invalid email address"],
###                         "password": ["Too small: expected string to have >=8 characters"] }
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hindi-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Malaking titik at espasyo — iisang tao na. I-send ang 7a, tapos 7b.
###    7a → 201, at ang naka-save ay "case-test@example.com" (lowercase, walang espasyo)
###         (sa pangalawang pagsubok, 409 na ang 7a)
###    7b → 409 Conflict — iisang email na sila pagkatapos linisin ni Zod
###    (Day 13: 201 — dalawang account para sa iisang tao)
# 7a
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "case-test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7b — parehong email, malaking titik at may espasyo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "  Case-Test@Example.COM ",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Dagdag na field na wala sa schema (hal. pagtatangkang maging admin). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  201 — at BINALEWALA ang "role"
###
### 🔐 Tinatanggal ni Zod ang mga field na wala sa schema, at `result.data` (hindi
### req.body) ang ginagamit ng code. Ito ang depensa laban sa "mass assignment".
### (Wala pang role column ngayon — pero kapag mayroon na sa Phase 10, protektado na.)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gusto-maging-admin-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Masyadong mahabang password (>128). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:  400 — "Too big: expected string to have <=128 characters"
###    🔐 Kung walang limit, puwedeng magpadala ng napakahabang password para
###    pahirapan ang argon2 at pabagalin ang server.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mahaba@example.com",
  "password": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}
